Shape log for dataset: MDT.csv
================================================================================

[cross_view_attention.first_batch]
prompt_feature shape: (32, 4, 256); meaning: intrinsic prompt reasoning features from LLM prompts, [batch*channels, patches, d_model]
semantic_features shape: (32, 4, 256); meaning: fused trend/seasonal/residual component semantics, [batch*channels, patches, d_model]
attention direction after this change: prompt_feature query semantic_features as key/value; output keeps prompt_feature as residual backbone
llm_features shape: (32, 4, 256); meaning: component-guided semantic features enriched by intrinsic prompt information, [batch*channels, patches, d_model]

[detect_multi_fit.train_first_batch]
seq_len/window length: 24
batch_size config: 32
batch_x_time shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; normalized sliding-window time-series batch
trend_stl shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; STL trend supervision aligned to each window
season_stl shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; STL seasonal supervision aligned to each window
residual_stl shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; STL residual supervision aligned to each window
outputs_mu shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; reconstructed mean time-series window
outputs_logvar shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; reconstructed log variance
logits_per_time shape: (32, 4, 4); meaning: [batch*channels, patches, patches]; time-to-semantic similarity logits
logits_per_text shape: (32, 4, 4); meaning: [batch*channels, patches, patches]; semantic-to-time similarity logits
total_mask shape: (32, 4, 1); meaning: [batch*channels, patches, 1]; information condenser keep probability

[detect_multi_label.train_threshold_first_batch]
seq_len/window length: 24
batch_size config: 32
batch_x_time shape: (32, 24, 1); meaning: [batch, seq_len, channels]; training windows used to estimate threshold energy
